  "referenceNumber": "CAF0024",
  "remarks": "\nSYTII is an involved person under the Central African Republic (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2020 as he \nis associated with an involved person, the Wagner Group. The Wagner Group is an involved person under the Regulations since it is or has been involved in a relevant activity, namely the commission of violations of international humanitarian law in the Central African Republic, in particular the deliberate targeting of civilians. \n",
